    <p class="hero-sub">
      Three automated trading bots on Micro E&#8209;mini Nasdaq futures, running side by side on one
      Interactive Brokers account &mdash; two at the New York open, one overnight. Signal detection,
      order management and exits are fully automated.
    </p>
