    <div class="perf-tile">
      <div class="perf-eyebrow">All 3 bots &middot; backtest net P&amp;L</div>
      <div class="perf-num green" data-counter data-prefix="+" data-symbol="$" data-target="52288">+$52,288</div>
      <div class="perf-sub">Oct 2025 &ndash; Sep 2026 &middot; 536 trades &middot; one account</div>
    </div>
    <div class="perf-tile">
      <div class="perf-eyebrow">Average month</div>
      <div class="perf-num blue" data-counter data-prefix="+" data-symbol="$" data-target="4357">+$4,357</div>
      <div class="perf-sub">10 of 12 months green &middot; +$200 per trading day</div>
    </div>
    <div class="perf-tile">
      <div class="perf-eyebrow">Lowest point vs start</div>
      <div class="perf-num" data-counter data-prefix="−" data-symbol="$" data-target="1538">−$1,538</div>
      <div class="perf-sub">Biggest drop from a high $3,444 &middot; profit factor 1.67</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── THE BOTS ── -->
  <section>
    <div class="section-label">The Bots</div>
    <div class="bot-grid">

      <article class="bot-card">
        <div class="bot-head">
          <div class="bot-name">NY Open &middot; ICT Model</div>
          <div class="bot-when">9:30&ndash;11:00 AM ET</div>
        </div>
        <p class="bot-desc">
          Scores fair value gaps on the 4&#8209;hour, 1&#8209;hour, 30&#8209;minute and 15&#8209;minute charts to set a
          daily bias, then waits for a liquidity sweep of a key level, a displacement candle and an inverting
          fair value gap before entering at market.
        </p>
        <ul class="bot-rules">
          <li>Skips flat opens: overnight gap under 0.15&times; the 14&#8209;day average range</li>
          <li>Stop beyond the last ten 1&#8209;minute bars; target at the next swing draw on liquidity</li>
          <li>Premium/discount filter and MES divergence veto</li>
          <li>Risk &le; $450 &middot; &le; 8 MNQ &middot; max 2 trades a day</li>
          <li>Break-even on structure, FVG obstacles or MES divergence; closes anything open at 11:00</li>
        </ul>
        <table class="bot-stats">
          <tr><td>Backtest net</td><td class="pos-t">+$17,014</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Trades</td><td>172 &middot; 25.6% wins</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Profit factor</td><td>1.86</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Avg win / loss</td><td>+$836 / −$291</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Lowest vs start</td><td class="neg-t">−$288</td></tr>
        </table>
