        </p>
        <ul class="bot-rules">
          <li>6 MNQ &middot; 30&#8209;point stop &middot; 90&#8209;point target (3R)</li>
          <li>Stop moves to entry once the trade is +30 points</li>
          <li>Max 3 trades a day; stops for the day at −$1,500</li>
